{
  "id": "resistors___color_codes_calculator",
  "title": "Resistors - Color Codes Calculator",
  "description": "A calculator tool for determining resistor values from color codes. Supports both four-band and five-band fixed resistors with color code interpretation.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Resistors - Color Codes Calculator\n\n## Color Code Reference\n\n| Color  | Significant Figures | Multiplier | Tolerance   |\n|--------|-------------------|-----------|-------------|\n| Silver |                   | 10⁻²      | ±10%       |\n| Gold   |                   | 10⁻¹      | ±5%        |\n| Black  | 0                 | 1         |            |\n| Brown  | 1                 | 10        | ±1%        |\n| Red    | 2                 | 10²       | ±2%        |\n| Orange | 3                 | 10³       |            |\n| Yellow | 4                 | 10⁴       |            |\n| Green  | 5                 | 10⁵       | ±0.5%      |\n| Blue   | 6                 | 10⁶       | ±0.25%     |\n| Violet | 7                 | 10⁷       | ±0.1%      |\n| Grey   | 8                 | 10⁸       |            |\n| White  | 9                 | 10⁹       |            |\n| None   |                   |           | ±20%       |"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Four Band Resistor Calculator"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "band1_4",
          "label": "Band 1 (First Digit)",
          "type": "select",
